# What `railway up` must not upload from this machine.
#
# The CLI already honours .gitignore, and `*.env` is the first rule there, so
# secrets/webhook-credentials.env is excluded twice over. It is named again here
# for the same reason .dockerignore names it: the file is on the disk whatever
# git thinks, this is an upload to a third party, and a rule that only exists
# somewhere else is a rule one refactor away from not existing.
secrets/

.git/
.github/
.claude/
.turbo/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
packages/db/generated/
docs/
reference/
.DS_Store
